---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Franchises — Brian Beers"
  description="Franchise exploration hub under the Buy journey — weigh fit, fees, territory, and playbook vs building your own."
>
  <section class="section max-w-3xl !pb-8">
    <nav class="text-sm text-navy/50" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/buy" class="font-medium hover:text-accent">Buy</a>
      <span class="mx-2">/</span>
      <span class="text-navy/70">Franchises</span>
    </nav>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Buy · Franchises</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-5xl">Franchise hub</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-navy/75">
      Franchising is one vehicle under the Buy journey — useful when brand systems, training, and territory
      rules match your goals. This hub is the SEO landing for franchise exploration; brand directories and
      disclosures can land here later.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section max-w-3xl !pt-0">
    <div class="card space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">What to weigh</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-navy/75">
        <li>Fit with your lifestyle and capital range</li>
        <li>Territory, fees, and ongoing obligations</li>
        <li>Whether you want a playbook vs. building your own brand</li>
        <li>How franchising compares to independent models you like</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy">When franchising can fit</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy/65">
          You want proven systems, brand recognition, and structured training — and you’re comfortable with
          fees and operating rules.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy">When an independent model may fit better</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy/65">
          You want full brand control, flexible pricing, or a niche the franchise catalogs don’t cover well.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/models" class="btn-secondary">Compare models</a>
      <a href="/buy" class="btn-secondary">Back to Buy</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Ask about franchises</a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 text-xs leading-relaxed text-navy/50">
      Educational framing only — not an offer to sell a franchise, not financial advice, and not earnings claims.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
